?page "PMTSCR - Payment Entry Screen"
?section IDENTIFICATION
*
*  SCREEN NAME:   PMTSCR
*  DESCRIPTION:   Workers' Compensation Payment Entry and Processing Screen
*  SYSTEM:        Claims Management System (CMS)
*  PATHWAY:       PMTSRV (Payment Server Class)
*  AUTHOR:        TPA Systems Development
*  DATE:          2024-04-10
*  MODIFIED:      2025-02-18 - Added EFT/ACH routing, duplicate detection
*
*  Handles all payment types: medical, indemnity (TTD/TPD/PPD/PTD),
*  expense, and legal. Enforces fee schedule compliance for medical
*  payments. Checks for duplicate payments before submission.
*  Interfaces with check-writing system via PATHSEND to $CHKWR.
*
?section DATA
*
*    Copybook references
           COPY WCPMTCPY
*
SCREEN PMTSCR.
*
    01 PMT-SCREEN-RECORD.
*
*--- Claim Header Area (Lines 1-2)
*
       05 PMT-HDR-CLAIM-NBR       PIC X(12)
           AT 1, 2
           DISPLAY LENGTH 12
           PROTECTED
           VALUE SPACES.
       05 PMT-HDR-CLAIMANT-NAME   PIC X(30)
           AT 1, 16
           DISPLAY LENGTH 30
           PROTECTED
           VALUE SPACES.
       05 PMT-HDR-DOI             PIC X(10)
           AT 1, 50
           DISPLAY LENGTH 10
           PROTECTED
           VALUE SPACES.
       05 PMT-HDR-JURISDICTION    PIC X(2)
           AT 1, 64
           DISPLAY LENGTH 2
           PROTECTED
           VALUE SPACES.
       05 PMT-HDR-EMPLOYER-NAME   PIC X(30)
           AT 2, 16
           DISPLAY LENGTH 30
           PROTECTED
           VALUE SPACES.
       05 PMT-HDR-COMP-STATUS     PIC X(12)
           AT 2, 50
           DISPLAY LENGTH 12
           PROTECTED
           VALUE SPACES.
*
*--- Payment Type Selection (Line 4)
*
       05 PMT-TYPE-CODE           PIC X(2)
           AT 4, 18
           DISPLAY LENGTH 2
           UPSHIFT.
       05 PMT-TYPE-DESC           PIC X(30)
           AT 4, 23
           DISPLAY LENGTH 30
           PROTECTED.
       05 PMT-TYPE-HELP           PIC X(40)
           AT 4, 38
