           VALUE "(MD=Medical IN=Indemnity EX=Expense LG=Legal)".
*
*--- Payee Selection (Lines 5-6)
*
       05 PMT-PAYEE-TYPE          PIC X(2)
           AT 5, 18
           DISPLAY LENGTH 2
           UPSHIFT.
       05 PMT-PAYEE-TYPE-HELP     PIC X(46)
           AT 5, 23
           DISPLAY LENGTH 46
           PROTECTED
           VALUE "(CL=Claimant PR=Provider AT=Attorney VN=Vendor)".
       05 PMT-PAYEE-ID            PIC X(12)
