       05 PMT-PAYEE-TIN           PIC X(11)
           AT 6, 70
           DISPLAY LENGTH 11
           PROTECTED.
*
*--- Payment Details (Lines 8-11)
*
       05 PMT-AMOUNT              PIC ZZZ,ZZZ.99
           AT 8, 18
           DISPLAY LENGTH 10
