       05 PMT-METHOD-HELP         PIC X(24)
           AT 8, 54
           DISPLAY LENGTH 24
           PROTECTED
           VALUE "(CHK=Check EFT=EFT/ACH)".
*
*   Indemnity date range (for TTD/TPD/PPD/PTD payments)
*
       05 PMT-PERIOD-FROM         PIC X(10)
           AT 9, 18
           DISPLAY LENGTH 10.
       05 PMT-PERIOD-TO           PIC X(10)
           AT 9, 33
           DISPLAY LENGTH 10.
       05 PMT-WEEKS-LABEL         PIC X(6)
