           VALUE "Weeks:".
       05 PMT-WEEKS-COUNT         PIC ZZ9.99
           AT 9, 55
           DISPLAY LENGTH 6
           PROTECTED.
*
*   EFT/ACH routing information
*
       05 PMT-EFT-ROUTING         PIC X(9)
           AT 10, 18
           DISPLAY LENGTH 9.
