       05 PMT-SVC-DOS-TO-2        PIC X(10)
           AT 18, 34
           DISPLAY LENGTH 10.
       05 PMT-SVC-BILLED-2        PIC ZZ,ZZ9.99
           AT 18, 46
           DISPLAY LENGTH 9.
       05 PMT-SVC-ALLOWED-2       PIC ZZ,ZZ9.99
           AT 18, 57
